Error: Jet.ReadOnlyValueNotOwned: `value` was not moved here, so it cannot be returned as-is
  --> Tests/UI/Ownership/deferred_lambda_capture_reports_once.jet:1:45
    |
  1 | see: fn(value: String) -[]> String { return value }
    |                                             ^^^^^
 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Return a copy: `return value.copy()` — or take ownership: `value: ^^String`. To return borrowed data, declare `-> View<T> from value` and return a view derived from `value`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ReadOnlyValueNotOwned

Error: Jet.UseWhileWriteActive: `value` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> Tests/UI/Ownership/deferred_lambda_capture_reports_once.jet:10:28
    |
 10 |     both(value, fn() { see(value) })
    |                            ^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through a write parameter, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass `value` only once, or copy first with `value.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UseWhileWriteActive
